<title>LEBANON: Lebanon markets closed for Eid al-Fitr.</title>
<headline>Lebanon markets closed for Eid al-Fitr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon's banks and financial markets were closed on Monday for the Moslem Eid al-Fitr holiday which marks the end of the holy month of Ramadan.</p>
</text>
